{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15548","headline":"小苑春望宫池柳色 · 张昔","name":"小苑春望宫池柳色","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小苑春初至，皇衢日更清。\n遥分万条柳，回出九重城。\n隐映龙池润，参差凤阙明。\n影宜宫雪曙，色带禁烟晴。\n深浅残阳变，高低晓吹轻。\n年光正堪折，欲寄一枝荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15548.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15548","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}